# Knobs at their limits on a full-scale sweep: everything at 255 (heavy compression, full drive), then P1 0, then pan 0
# (dry). The clipper keeps the processed signal below -0.18 dBFS throughout.
tempo 120
steps 24
tail 0.2
track fx2
input sweep 30 16000 0.99
preset 255 255 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
param p1 0 8
param p2 0 12
param pan 0 16
gain 1
note 2 C4 2 127
expect sound 0 24
expect peak_below 0
